    narr:narration """The trajectory of [decision capture at the point of consensus](narr:Position_CoreFeatureDecisionCapture) has stabilized into a phase of technical execution and performance validation. Following the initial March 2026 product thesis, the narrative has shifted from conceptual definition to the [shipment of the async decision widget](narr:Expr_1E2ETanyaCollab1786872563090_1) in August 2026. This delivery is now framed through the lens of operational throughput, specifically citing [record-high velocity metrics](narr:Expr_1E2ETanyaCollab1786872563090_2) as evidence of the product's maturing competence. The [Zephyr integration](narr:Expr_1E2ETanyaCollab1786872563090_3) is identified as the primary technical catalyst underpinning this recent acceleration, marking a transition where the differentiator is no longer just a framework, but a demonstrated functional reality.""" ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1E2ETanyaCollab1786872563090_1> ;
